    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there is help out there but it’s all just more bureaucracy. more forms, more waiting, more people telling me to \"reach out\" while i'm still stuck in this hole. it feels like the only way to actually win against a system this broken is to just opt out. if the world doesn't have a place for me, why am i even trying to force my way into it?",
